greedy) algorithms from the previous sections (for the FSC and
FWSC problems) easily extend to GFSC and GFWSC with similar
theoretical guarantees. The high level idea is the following: In each
iteration of the greedy algorithm, instead of selecting exactly one
set from each group, the algorithm selects 𝑝ℎsets for group gℎ. The
