6.1 The𝜀-GFSC problem
Our algorithms for the GFSC problem can be used for the less
constrained 𝜀-GFSC problem, where, instead of zero unfairness,
the goal is to ensure a maximum unfairness of 𝜀. Particularly, in
Theorem 9, we show that a solver for the GFSC problem provides a
good approximation for the 𝜀-GFSC problem.
Theorem 9. Any𝛼-approximation algorithm for the GFSC prob-
