gℎ, in𝑋∗𝜀. In the end, notice that |𝑋′𝜀∩Sℎ|=(1+𝜀)𝑓ℎ|𝑋∗𝜀|for
every group gℎ, and|𝑋′𝜀|=(1+𝜀)|𝑋∗𝜀|. Hence,|𝑋′
