B.3 Extensions to GFWSC
Using the results in § 5, all our algorithms for the weighted case
can be extended to the generalized FSC. Skipping the details, we
have the following theorem.
Theorem 12. There exists a Δ(ln𝑛+1)-approximation algorithm
for the Generalized FWSC problem that runs in 𝑂(𝑚𝑝𝑛)time.
